{"seq":2,"slug":"reserves-capital-model-risk","title":"准备金、资本占用与模型风险：VA、FRTB 与 SIMM","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/volatility-surface-exotic-market-making/hedging-risk-compliance/reserves-capital-model-risk","wordCount":2977,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"准备金-资本占用与模型风险-va-frtb-与-simm\">准备金、资本占用与模型风险：VA、FRTB 与 SIMM</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>一个奇异期权做市台在行情好时账面利润可观，但真正决定它能否长期存活的是三本账：<strong>估值准备金</strong>（valuation adjustments，统称 xVA）削掉乐观报价，<strong>监管资本</strong>（FRTB 市场风险资本）锁定无法自由动用的资本，<strong>初始保证金</strong>（由 ISDA SIMM 计算）在双边交易中实打实地占用现金。三者都不是会计噪音——它们是做市商必须计入每一张奇异期权报价的<strong>持有成本</strong>。一个报得出漂亮 mid 价、却算不准这三项成本的系统，会在压力情景里被自己的资产负债表挤死。</p>\n<p>核心矛盾在于：这三本账都要求对<strong>同一批奇异头寸</strong>给出一个「审慎但一致」的价值估计，而奇异期权的估值恰恰最不确定。VIX 类、障碍类、雪球类的曲面敏感度极高，参数一点点偏移就能让模型价格跳动几个百分点。于是监管与行业选择了两条正交路径来消化这种不确定性：<strong>模型内部</strong>用估值调整把模型缺陷折价成钱，<strong>模型外部</strong>用 FRTB 与 SIMM 把风险折算成资本与保证金。两条路径都必须可审计、可回溯、可被独立验证。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[奇异期权头寸&lt;br/&gt;VIX / 障碍 / 雪球] --&gt; B[估值引擎&lt;br/&gt;LSV / Heston / 局部波动率]&#10;    B --&gt; C[估值准备金 xVA]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[CVA 对手信用]&#10;    C --&gt; C2[FVA 融资]&#10;    C --&gt; C3[AvA / 模型风险准备金]&#10;    B --&gt; D[风险计量]&#10;    D --&gt; E[FRTB IMA&lt;br/&gt;ES + 流动性期限]&#10;    D --&gt; F[SA-CVA&lt;br/&gt;敏感性法]&#10;    D --&gt; G[ISDA SIMM&lt;br/&gt;初始保证金]&#10;    C3 --&gt; H[报价: mid - 准备金 - 资本费]&#10;    E --&gt; H&#10;    G --&gt; H&#10;    H --&gt; I[最终客户报价]\">graph TD\n    A[奇异期权头寸&lt;br/&gt;VIX / 障碍 / 雪球] --&gt; B[估值引擎&lt;br/&gt;LSV / Heston / 局部波动率]\n    B --&gt; C[估值准备金 xVA]\n    C --&gt; C1[CVA 对手信用]\n    C --&gt; C2[FVA 融资]\n    C --&gt; C3[AvA / 模型风险准备金]\n    B --&gt; D[风险计量]\n    D --&gt; E[FRTB IMA&lt;br/&gt;ES + 流动性期限]\n    D --&gt; F[SA-CVA&lt;br/&gt;敏感性法]\n    D --&gt; G[ISDA SIMM&lt;br/&gt;初始保证金]\n    C3 --&gt; H[报价: mid - 准备金 - 资本费]\n    E --&gt; H\n    G --&gt; H\n    H --&gt; I[最终客户报价]</pre><p>一次「审慎折价」发生在上图的每一层，任何一层的口径漂移都会污染最终报价。下表把三本账的关键属性并列，后面各节逐一展开。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>估值准备金 xVA</th>\n<th>监管资本 FRTB</th>\n<th>初始保证金 SIMM</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>触发方</td>\n<td>会计/审慎监管</td>\n<td>巴塞尔委员会（BCBS）</td>\n<td>ISDA 双边协议</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>覆盖风险</td>\n<td>模型缺陷、信用、融资</td>\n<td>市场风险（IMA/SA）</td>\n<td>场外衍生品交易对手风险</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>奇权重</td>\n<td>VIX/障碍对模型风险最敏感</td>\n<td>非模态风险 + 流动性期限</td>\n<td>奇异期权的 vega/curvature</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>计量方法</td>\n<td>逐笔重估 + 参数扰动</td>\n<td>ES（IMA）/ 敏感性法（SA）</td>\n<td>敏感性 + 集中度 + 曲率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2026 状态</td>\n<td>已成为报价标配</td>\n<td>主要辖区陆续落地中</td>\n<td>半年度版本迭代（v2.x）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"估值准备金-把模型不确定性折成钱\">估值准备金：把模型不确定性折成钱</h2><p>估值准备金回答的是「模型给出的价格里，有多少是因为模型本身不完美而多算的」。对奇异期权台，最相关的是三类：<strong>CVA</strong>（对手方信用估值调整）、<strong>FVA</strong>（融资估值调整），以及广义的 <strong>AvA</strong>（additional valuation adjustment，模型风险准备金）。CVA 把「对手可能违约」折算成一个从 mid 价中扣掉的项：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>CVA</mtext><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>R</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><mtext>EE</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mtext>PD</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CVA} = (1-R)\\sum_{i} \\text{EE}(t_i)\\,\\text{PD}(t_{i-1},t_i)\\,D(t_i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CVA</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3277em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">EE</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">PD</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 为回收率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>EE</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{EE}(t_i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">EE</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 为时点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的预期敞口，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>PD</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{PD}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">PD</span></span></span></span></span></span> 为边际违约概率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D(t_i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 为贴现因子，求和覆盖所有重估时间点。奇异期权的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>EE</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{EE}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">EE</span></span></span></span></span></span> 曲线极难估准——障碍敲出会瞬间改变敞口方向，这使 CVA 本身成为一个高模型风险量。</p>\n<p><strong>AvA / 模型风险准备金</strong>是奇异台真正的痛点。巴塞尔 <strong>FRTB 的 CVA 风险框架</strong>（BCBS d507 及后续修订）要求对 CVA 模型本身计提资本，而更早的 <strong>审慎估值准则</strong>（如 EU 的 CRR 第 105 条、PRA 的 SS3/21）则要求机构对「非模态产品」按 Prudent Valuation 规则计提 AvA。奇异期权几乎全部落在非模态篮子里，因为它的同业报价不可得、模型参数不可直接观察。AvA 的可操作定义是：对每一个不确定的输入参数做审慎的向上/向下偏移，取价格分布中不利的一侧。对 VIX 期权，最敏感的参数通常是<strong>波动率的波动率（vol-of-vol）<strong>和</strong>相关性</strong>；对雪球（autocallable），则是最初假设的<strong>对冲路径</strong>与<strong>发行人相关性</strong>。</p>\n<p>实务中的报告口径要求把 AvA 拆成可归因的桶（market price uncertainty、close-out costs、model risk、concentrated positions 等），每一步扰动都要留痕，以便审计复原。这也是为什么做市系统必须保留「未加准备金」的 mid 价与每一层准备金分项，而不是只存一个最终报价。</p>\n<h2 id=\"frtb-市场风险资本的-2026-落地\">FRTB：市场风险资本的 2026 落地</h2><p><strong>FRTB</strong>（Fundamental Review of the Trading Book，巴塞尔委员会 2016 年定稿、经 2019 年修订）替换了旧的市场风险框架，核心变化是把资本计量从 VaR 转向<strong>预期短缺 ES</strong>，并强制区分<strong>可建模交易台</strong>（IMA）与<strong>不可建模交易台</strong>（SA）。对奇异期权台，关键点是：奇异产品是 IMA 最常见的「出局区」。</p>\n<p>进入 IMA 的门槛是<strong>两个测试</strong>——交易台通过 P&amp;L attribution（损益归因）测试和 backtesting（回测）测试。损益归因要求风险理论 P&amp;L 与实际 P&amp;L 的偏差在容忍区间内；奇异期权的模型价格对曲面参数高度非线性，理论 P&amp;L 常常与真实 P&amp;L 显著背离，导致交易台掉出 IMA，被迫回落到<strong>敏感性法（SA）</strong>——而 SA 对 vega、curvature 的资本要求通常显著更高。</p>\n<p>IMA 的 ES 计算还有一个专门针对奇异的机制：<strong>流动性期限（liquidity horizon）</strong>。不同风险因子被赋予不同持有期假设——利率与主要权益指数通常 10 天，而复杂奇异产品对应的风险因子可长达 60 天甚至 120 天。ES 随期限近似按平方根缩放，因此奇异台无法像线性产品台那样享受短期限红利：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>ES</mtext><mtext>liquidity</mtext></msub><mo>≈</mo><msub><mtext>ES</mtext><mrow><mn>10</mn><mtext>d</mtext></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mi>L</mi><mi>H</mi></mrow><mn>10</mn></mfrac></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{ES}_{\\text{liquidity}} \\approx \\text{ES}_{10\\text{d}} \\times \\sqrt{\\frac{LH}{10}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ES</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">liquidity</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ES</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">10</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.44em;vertical-align:-0.769em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.671em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-4.4em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.4em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:1em;\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">10</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.631em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.4em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:1.02em;height:2.48em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"2.48em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 2592\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M424,2478\nc-1.3,-0.7,-38.5,-172,-111.5,-514c-73,-342,-109.8,-513.3,-110.5,-514\nc0,-2,-10.7,14.3,-32,49c-4.7,7.3,-9.8,15.7,-15.5,25c-5.7,9.3,-9.8,16,-12.5,20\ns-5,7,-5,7c-4,-3.3,-8.3,-7.7,-13,-13s-13,-13,-13,-13s76,-122,76,-122s77,-121,77,-121\ns209,968,209,968c0,-2,84.7,-361.7,254,-1079c169.3,-717.3,254.7,-1077.7,256,-1081\nl0 -0c4,-6.7,10,-10,18,-10 H400000\nv40H1014.6\ns-87.3,378.7,-272.6,1166c-185.3,787.3,-279.3,1182.3,-282,1185\nc-2,6,-10,9,-24,9\nc-8,0,-12,-0.7,-12,-2z M1001 80\nh400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.769em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">LH</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span> 为该风险因子的流动性期限（天）。一个持有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mi>H</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>60</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">LH=60</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">60</span></span></span></span></span> 的奇异敞口，等效资本约是 10 天口径的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt><mo>≈</mo><mn>2.45</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sqrt{6}\\approx 2.45</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.04em;vertical-align:-0.1328em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9072em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord\">6</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.8672em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1328em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.45</span></span></span></span></span> 倍。这直接抬高了做市台持有奇异库存的成本，也是 2026 年做市商倾向用**代理对冲（proxy hedging）**把风险转移回流动性好的线性工具的原因。</p>\n<p>落地节奏上，主要辖区时间表并不一致：EU 通过 CRR3 于 2025 年起实施 FRTB；英国 PRA 分阶段推进，自营交易台（trading book）的 IMA 部分在 2027 年前后逐步生效；美国 2023 年 Basel III Endgame 提案原计划 2025 年 7 月起过渡，但 2024–2025 年间监管表态出现回摆，时间表被重新审视。做市系统因此必须同时支持<strong>双口径</strong>——IMA 的 ES 与 SA 的敏感性——以便随时切换。</p>\n<h2 id=\"isda-simm-初始保证金与奇异期权的曲率项\">ISDA SIMM：初始保证金与奇异期权的曲率项</h2><p><strong>初始保证金</strong>（initial margin）是 2008 年后 G20 改革对非集中清算衍生品的要求，按 <strong>ISDA SIMM</strong>（Standard Initial Margin Model）计量。SIMM 的核心是「用敏感性近似组合的潜在未来敞口」，它把十个风险类（利率、外汇、权益、商品、信用等）各自的风险因子敏感性做加权、相关化后聚合。对奇异期权，SIMM 里最关键的是权益风险类下的<strong>曲率项（curvature）</strong>。</p>\n<p>曲率风险捕获的是「组合价值对标的二阶/更复杂的依赖」，恰恰是障碍、雪球、VIX 期权的本质。SIMM 对曲率采用<strong>上行/下行重估</strong>的固定情景：把所有权益风险因子统一平移一个固定幅度（如 +/− <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span>），重估组合，取不利一侧与 delta/gamma 已捕获部分之差，作为残余曲率风险。这意味着奇异台必须能对同一组合在多个压力情景下快速重估——你不能靠解析公式糊弄，必须有一个够快的定价引擎。</p>\n<p>SIMM 的版本迭代是运维现实。ISDA 每半年发布新版本，对相关矩阵、风险权重、曲率阈值做微调；交易双方必须<strong>协商并签约</strong>使用同一版本，否则保证金计算口径不一致会引发争议。奇异台因此要维护一个版本可配置的 SIMM 计算器，且每次升版都要跑回归，量化对保证金占用的影响。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>SIMM 组件</th>\n<th>对奇异期权的敏感点</th>\n<th>做市系统的应对</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>敏感性（delta/vega）</td>\n<td>vega 对高曲率产品定价偏差敏感</td>\n<td>用曲面一致的重估而非 B-S 解析 vega</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>曲率（curvature）</td>\n<td>障碍/雪球的核心风险</td>\n<td>多情景重估引擎，低延迟</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>集中度（concentration）</td>\n<td>与单一对手大宗奇异敞口</td>\n<td>头寸限额 + 对手分散</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>版本/相关矩阵</td>\n<td>半年升版改变占用</td>\n<td>版本可配置 + 升版回归</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"模型风险治理-独立验证与-reserve-反馈环\">模型风险治理：独立验证与 reserve 反馈环</h2><p>模型风险不是一次性计提，而是一个<strong>反馈环</strong>。任何进入报价准备的模型——局部随机波动率（LSV）、Heston、SABR 校准——都必须经过独立验证（independent model validation），验证的结论要反馈到准备金口径。治理上有三个可操作的抓手：</p>\n<p>其一是<strong>参数边界与失效检测</strong>。奇异的 vol-of-vol、跳跃强度等参数在极端市场会跳出校准区间，系统应在检测到参数越界时自动上调 AvA，而非静默外推。其二是<strong>准备金与 P&amp;L 的对账</strong>。每期把实际实现 P&amp;L 与「有准备金价格」的预期 P&amp;L 对比，若准备金长期单向偏离（例如持续多提），说明口径过保守，侵蚀竞争力；若持续少提，说明模型风险被低估。其三是<strong>压力情景入库</strong>。把历史上真实击穿过的情景（如 2020 年 3 月的 vol 爆炸、2018 年 VIX 空头清算）固化进回测库，定期用它们重估当前组合。</p>\n<p>一个实用的报价公式把三本账显式纳入最终价：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Quote</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>Mid</mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext>xVA</mtext><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>λ</mi><mtext>cap</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mtext>Capital</mtext><mtext>FRTB</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>λ</mi><mtext>IM</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mtext>IM</mtext><mtext>SIMM</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Quote} = \\text{Mid} - \\text{xVA} - \\lambda_{\\text{cap}}\\cdot \\text{Capital}_{\\text{FRTB}} - \\lambda_{\\text{IM}}\\cdot \\text{IM}_{\\text{SIMM}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Quote</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Mid</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">xVA</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">cap</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9386em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Capital</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2342em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">FRTB</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">IM</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">IM</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">SIMM</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mtext>cap</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda_{\\text{cap}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">cap</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mtext>IM</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda_{\\text{IM}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">IM</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是资本与保证金占用的<strong>目标回报系数</strong>（把占用资本折算成报价里的成本）。当 FRTB 把奇异台踢出 IMA、或 SIMM 升版抬高曲率权重时，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 项会变大，报价随之走阔——这是监管口径直接渗入商业定价的通道。做市系统的工程要求是：这条链路必须可观测，任一准备金或资本项的变化都能追溯到它对某一笔报价的具体影响。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>奇异做市台有三本成本账：估值准备金 xVA、监管资本 FRTB、初始保证金 SIMM，三者都导致实际报价低于账面 mid。</li>\n<li>xVA 的重点在 AvA/模型风险准备金——奇异产品属「非模态」，需对不确定参数做审慎偏移，并保留可审计的扰动痕迹。</li>\n<li>FRTB 用 ES 替换 VaR，奇异台常因损益归因测试不过而掉出 IMA，被迫用资本要求更高的 SA；流动性期限机制让持仓成本按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msqrt><mrow><mi>L</mi><mi>H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>10</mn></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sqrt{LH/10}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.24em;vertical-align:-0.305em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.935em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3.2em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:1em;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mord\">/10</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.895em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:1.02em;height:1.28em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.28em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1296\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M263,681c0.7,0,18,39.7,52,119\nc34,79.3,68.167,158.7,102.5,238c34.3,79.3,51.8,119.3,52.5,120\nc340,-704.7,510.7,-1060.3,512,-1067\nl0 -0\nc4.7,-7.3,11,-11,19,-11\nH40000v40H1012.3\ns-271.3,567,-271.3,567c-38.7,80.7,-84,175,-136,283c-52,108,-89.167,185.3,-111.5,232\nc-22.3,46.7,-33.8,70.3,-34.5,71c-4.7,4.7,-12.3,7,-23,7s-12,-1,-12,-1\ns-109,-253,-109,-253c-72.7,-168,-109.3,-252,-110,-252c-10.7,8,-22,16.7,-34,26\nc-22,17.3,-33.3,26,-34,26s-26,-26,-26,-26s76,-59,76,-59s76,-60,76,-60z\nM1001 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.305em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 放大。</li>\n<li>SIMM 的曲率项专门捕获障碍/雪球类风险，要求低延迟的多情景重估引擎；半年版本迭代需版本可配置并做回归。</li>\n<li>2026 年各辖区落地节奏不一（EU 已实施、UK 分阶段、US 时间表回摆），系统必须支持 IMA/SA 双口径随时切换。</li>\n<li>模型风险治理是反馈环：参数越界自动上调 AvA、准备金与实现 P&amp;L 定期对账、历史击穿情景入库回测。</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    R[监管口径变化&lt;br/&gt;FRTB / SIMM 版本] --&gt; Q[报价公式 λ 项]&#10;    M[模型验证结论] --&gt; A[AvA 准备金]&#10;    A --&gt; Q&#10;    Q --&gt; P[客户最终报价]&#10;    P --&gt; N[成交与库存]&#10;    N --&gt; E[风险计量 ES/IMA]&#10;    E --&gt; R\">graph TD\n    R[监管口径变化&lt;br/&gt;FRTB / SIMM 版本] --&gt; Q[报价公式 λ 项]\n    M[模型验证结论] --&gt; A[AvA 准备金]\n    A --&gt; Q\n    Q --&gt; P[客户最终报价]\n    P --&gt; N[成交与库存]\n    N --&gt; E[风险计量 ES/IMA]\n    E --&gt; R</pre><p>本篇与同章的 <a href=\"vega-gamma-hedging\">Vega 与 Gamma 对冲</a> 互补：那篇讲如何用代理对冲削减奇异敞口，本篇讲削减后的残余风险如何被折算成准备金、资本与保证金。同一章 <a href=\"risk-limits-stress-anomaly\">风险限额、压力测试与异常检测</a> 则给出限额与压力情景的工程细节，是模型风险反馈环的执行层。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"准备金、资本占用与模型风险：VA、FRTB 与 SIMM","id":"准备金-资本占用与模型风险-va-frtb-与-simm"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"估值准备金：把模型不确定性折成钱","id":"估值准备金-把模型不确定性折成钱"},{"level":2,"text":"FRTB：市场风险资本的 2026 落地","id":"frtb-市场风险资本的-2026-落地"},{"level":2,"text":"ISDA SIMM：初始保证金与奇异期权的曲率项","id":"isda-simm-初始保证金与奇异期权的曲率项"},{"level":2,"text":"模型风险治理：独立验证与 reserve 反馈环","id":"模型风险治理-独立验证与-reserve-反馈环"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"波动率对冲实务：vega、gamma 与 vanna-volga 组合对冲","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/volatility-surface-exotic-market-making/hedging-risk-compliance/vega-gamma-hedging"},"next":{"title":"风险限额、压力测试与异常处置：跳空、流动性枯竭与暴雷","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/volatility-surface-exotic-market-making/hedging-risk-compliance/risk-limits-stress-anomaly"}}